# Conformance probe pack for a count inside an item body (spec 0.21 ruling 9),
# most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   items       an 8-bit count, then per item: n, a 4-bit count of subs; qty in
#               4 bits; n subs, val in 8 bits each
format     conformance-extents-item
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.items count 8
  count n 4
  field  probe.qty  4  uint
  group  probe.subs count @n
    field  probe.val  8  uint
  end
end
